		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "19e5c58a-3cac-5d89-a2d4-2feb2f293d53")
	)
	(text "7  Thresholds (2.5 V reference, PWM, filters, buffers), input clamp rail, trigger in / out"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c5f3172-bafb-51c9-823b-35f69ee7678c")
	)
	(text "VTH = 0.2494 x duty x 2.495 V = 0 ... 0.622 V; at the probe x 5.03 = 0 ... 3.13 V, 0.76 mV per step with a 12-bit duty cycle.\nFilter: 75k x 100n (7.5 ms) then 10k x 100n: ripple of a 24 kHz PWM 0.14 mV pk-pk at the probe; settles to 1 mV in 117 ms (the\nstages load each other), so the gateware waits 120 ms after a change.  The gate's output resistance (< 62 ohm) is 0.02 % of 301k\n(0603: the 0.1 % 25 ppm part is not stocked in 0402).  The buffer drives the eight 1k threshold resistors and the hysteresis\ncurrents directly (22R + 10k / 10n isolate the 1 uF bus capacitor; with 22R a pod's 8 outputs switching together move its\nthreshold 7 mV at the probe, 24 mV with 100R).  100k pull-down: low while the FPGA is unconfigured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.258 39.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67cfa66a-c6c1-5bb1-b102-97a2de88b1f1")
	)
	(text "Cathode tied to REF: 2.495 V.  2.4 mA through 330R.  TL431B stability (TI SLVS543S figure 6-18, curve A): stable below about 5 nF or\nabove about 6 uF.  With TI's model an MLCC alone still rings below 15 uF, and the 22 uF 0805 may keep only 11 ... 15 uF at\n2.5 V; 1R in series damps it (clean from 6 uF up in simulation).  No small capacitor on this net."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 33.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a64a7cc4-80aa-5d8d-9a23-df165963cc97")
	)
	(text "2.5 V threshold reference (TL431B, 0.5 %)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 25.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d4635ba8-1c50-5901-b403-19ae41f3bc41")
	)
	(text "Threshold per pod: FPGA PWM -> gate on the 2.5 V reference -> 301k / 100k divider and filter -> buffer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.258 25.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d5cf67eb-5186-5f59-b354-a3a72dd72133")
	)
	(text "Input: 5 V tolerant Schmitt buffer behind 100R and an ESD diode, 100k pull-down.  Output: buffer through 33R."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.5735 139.198 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d6b70b9f-afce-5797-be73-39302c8c8e17")
	)
